          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Normalized Pauli form factor</strong> <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(R=F_2/(\u03b1/(2\u03c0))||)</marimo-tex></span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='RGSE-0' random-id='042c3c55-4e66-e58f-bec2-1b7dc514b1eb'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Re R&#92;&quot;:-0.8608178819280083,&#92;&quot;Im R&#92;&quot;:2.809925892416291,&#92;&quot;Absolute validation error&#92;&quot;:3.163823963282337e-14}]&quot;' data-total-rows='1' data-total-columns='3' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Multiply by <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\alpha/(2\\pi)||)</marimo-tex> to obtain <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(F_2||)</marimo-tex>. At zero transfer this gives <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(a_e=(g-2)/2||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span></div>"
